Package: co.r
Title: CO Universe DuckDB Interface
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("CO", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "dev@co.artelonga.com.br")
Description: Query CO universe data via DuckDB/SQLite from R.
    Connects to a per-universe data.db either from a local data directory
    or by downloading a snapshot from the CO API.
